{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"DeltaChat.DeltaChat","latestVersion":"2.65.0","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.49dede65.png","priority":1,"sha256":"49dede65c1149b0949273a7554daa9d9acf2ac6988dc2851060ff4a529783e64","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"A decentralized and secure messenger app","license":"GPL-3.0-or-later","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/deltachat/deltachat-desktop/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"A decentralized and secure messenger app","license":"GPL-3.0-or-later","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/deltachat/deltachat-desktop/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Delta Chat is a reliable, decentralized and secure messaging app, available for mobile and desktop platforms.\nDelta Chat feels like Whatsapp or Telegram but you can also use and regard it as an e-mail app. You can signup anonymously to a variety of interoperable chatmail servers which are minimal e-mail servers optimized for fast and secure operations. Or you may use classic e-mail servers and an existing e-mail account in which case Delta Chat acts as an e-mail app.","name":"DeltaChat","packageUrl":"https://delta.chat/en/download","publisher":"DeltaChat Developers","publisherUrl":"https://delta.chat/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/deltachat/deltachat-desktop/releases/tag/v2.65.0","tags":["chat","email","federated","mail","message","messaging","privacy","secure","security","send","talk"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"去中心化的安全聊天应用","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Delta Chat 是一款可靠、去中心化、安全的聊天应用，适用于手机和电脑。\nDelta Chat 类似 Whatsapp 或 Telegram，但您也可以把它当作电子邮件应用使用。您可以匿名注册到各种可互操作的聊天邮件服务器，这些服务器都是为快速、安全运行而优化的最小电子邮件服务器。您也可以使用传统的电子邮件服务器和现有的电子邮件账户，从而将 Delta Chat 当作电子邮件应用使用。","packageUrl":"https://delta.chat/zh_CN/download","publisherUrl":"https://delta.chat/zh_CN/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/deltachat/deltachat-desktop/releases/tag/v2.65.0","tags":["信息","发送","安全","消息","电子邮件","聊天","邮件","隐私"]}},"longDescription":"Delta Chat is a reliable, decentralized and secure messaging app, available for mobile and desktop platforms.\nDelta Chat feels like Whatsapp or Telegram but you can also use and regard it as an e-mail app. You can signup anonymously to a variety of interoperable chatmail servers which are minimal e-mail servers optimized for fast and secure operations. Or you may use classic e-mail servers and an existing e-mail account in which case Delta Chat acts as an e-mail app.","name":"DeltaChat","packageUrl":"https://delta.chat/en/download","publisher":"DeltaChat Developers","publisherUrl":"https://delta.chat/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/deltachat/deltachat-desktop/releases/tag/v2.65.0","tags":["chat","email","federated","mail","message","messaging","privacy","secure","security","send","talk"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.65.0/app.json","detailSha256":"e1bb1ecd930a2b201f81e2433d6bec94dc0cf1128aba7bc1c66d6a473b36355f","releaseDate":"2026-10-27","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"2.65.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.62.0/app.json","detailSha256":"e52ebe5f6ff348d4c4536d2631b5f9f41855debd94ff41ba4a3de047027ac8e1","releaseDate":"2026-09-27","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"2.62.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.59.1/app.json","detailSha256":"02520cf5c12559e92ed83362a5b6bdfabd1db744f6f21a9cb643192326e8e249","releaseDate":"2026-08-23","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"2.59.1"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.59.0/app.json","detailSha256":"a96709c290630d9a94112774459d4568ac883101304ed5995653e662a469668f","releaseDate":"2026-08-15","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"2.59.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.57.0/app.json","detailSha256":"75c70b770ee28f1b4439aea36c05880497d5cae43ddd33fb67039e0463cce940","releaseDate":"2026-07-26","releaseDateSource":"manife